'''Anna''' (Japanese: '''アンナ''') is one of the [[Ghost Master]]s located in the [[Sealed Fort]], located on [[GR Island]] in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game 2: The Invasion of Team GR!]] Anna can be found in the eighth of the nine statues in the main room. Players who defeat Anna will obtain a Present Pack, which can consist of any card that can be found in a booster pack in the game.

==Damage Chaos Deck==
'''Damage Chaos Deck''' (Japanese: '''ダメージだいこんらんデッキ''') is the deck played by Anna. The deck consists mainly of {{e|Psychic}} Pokémon and uses several cards that are exclusive to the game in the deck.

